{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certifies that on the 18/11/2024, the use of outbuilding rear of 38 Cains Lane, Feltham, TW14 9RH as a self-contained unit was not lawful within the meaning of Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reason:\r\nInsufficient evidence has been submitted to demonstrate that the outbuilding to which the application relates has been in continuous use as a separate self-contained unit for a period of at least four years, and the Council's own records also do not support the applicant's version of events.\r\n"
  ],
